sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Web as Web Client
    participant API as Backend API
    participant Collab as Realtime Collab Service
    participant Store as Yjs Snapshot Store

    User->>Web: Open shared document
    Web->>API: GET /v1/documents/:documentId
    API-->>Web: Metadata + permissions
    Web->>API: POST /v1/documents/:documentId/sessions
    API-->>Web: websocketUrl + token + session metadata
    Web->>Collab: Connect with token-authenticated session
    Collab->>Store: Load Yjs snapshot
    Store-->>Collab: Existing state or empty state
    Collab-->>Web: Presence + writer slot snapshot
    Collab-->>Web: Realtime document state
    Web->>Collab: Local edits / awareness updates
    Collab-->>Web: Remote edits / presence updates
